                <pb facs="0886" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg788"/>

                <head>Convention between the United States of America and the United States of
                    Mexico extending for an indefinite period the treaty of March 1, 1889, between
                    the two governments, known as the Water Boundary Convention.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington November 21, 1900.<lb/>Ratified by
                        Mexico December 12, 1900.<lb/>Ratification advised by the Senate December
                        15, 1900.<lb/>Ratified by the President December 24, 1900.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged December 24, 1900.<lb/>Proclaimed December 24, 1900.</hi></p>

                <xi:include href="ch94/d916.xml" xpointer="d916"/>
